# Build output.
#
# This directory reached 250 MB of compiled artifacts in this repository's
# history once already. The leading slash anchors it to the repository root;
# the second line catches a nested crate's target directory too.
/target
**/target/

# Rust
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
*.orig
*.rej

# Debug and profiling output
*.profraw
perf.data
perf.data.old
flamegraph.svg

# Editors and IDEs
.vscode/
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.zed/

# Operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Raw screen recordings. The demo the README embeds is docs/demo.gif, at about
# a megabyte; an uncompressed capture is twenty times that and nothing links to
# it. Compress one into docs/ rather than committing the capture.
/Record.gif
/Record*.mp4
/Record*.mov

# Local scratch space
/scratch/
/tmp/
*.log
